# Knowledge hierarchical URLs

- **Shape:** `/knowledge/{area}/{tab}` and optionally `/{chip}` when the tab has chips.
- **Sources of truth:** `apps/web/src/lib/knowledgeRoute.ts`, `knowledgeLegacyRedirects.ts`.
- **Do not** add new `to="/knowledge/…#…"` links; use `buildKnowledgePath` / `defaultPathForArea`.
- **Legacy hashes** belong only in `knowledgeLegacyRedirects.ts`.
- **Conjugation** still uses query params (`?group=`) — separate follow-up plan.
